## Insights Panel

Provides:

### Top 3 Cleanest Cities

Identifies cities with the best environmental conditions.

### Top 3 Most Polluted Cities

Highlights cities with the highest pollution levels.

### Biggest Anomaly

Detects unusual environmental patterns.

### Most Surprising Observation

Highlights unexpected findings.

### Recommended Actions

Suggests actionable improvements.

---

## Personalized Recommendations

### Daily Actions

* Reduce outdoor exposure during poor AQI
* Monitor environmental conditions regularly
* Improve indoor ventilation

### Indoor Air Improvements

* Use air purifiers
* Add indoor plants
* Maintain clean ventilation systems

### Outdoor Activity Guidance

* Schedule exercise during lower AQI periods
* Avoid outdoor activity during severe pollution

### Hair Care Recommendations

* Use filtered water when possible
* Protect hair from pollutants

### Skin Care Recommendations

* Maintain hydration
* Use protective skincare routines

### Water Quality Improvements

* Install water filters
* Regularly test water quality

